  "//": "Type checking of the pipeline scripts (scripts/publish, build, check, maps, dev, i18n) by JSDoc and checkJs (REFACTOR-PLAN.md item 2, stream rf-pipeline). Run by `npm run check:types:pipeline`. noImplicitAny is on (8 Nov 2026 review, stream S3; tests/unit/pipeline-typecheck.test.mjs keeps it on). The include list is an allowlist that only grows; the import-boundary and architecture checks (scripts/check/boundaries.mjs, architecture.mjs and architecture/) joined on 11 Nov 2026 (architecture rule R11: a new file joins its area's strict config); harvest-untranslated.mjs joined on 12 Nov 2026 (stream rf9-i18n): its page callbacks type the few browser globals they use themselves, so the config still has no DOM library. Full `strict` since 12 Nov 2026 (stream rf8-types: the catch variables are unknown, so each catch says it holds an Error); the strict-family flags are also set one by one, and the test keeps strict on.",
